-<a id="s4"></a>
-## 四、基线与证据目录
-
-### 4.1 开工条件
-
-当前工作树已有计划文档修改。开始代码施工前，必须先提交这些文档或建立明确 checkpoint；
-不得把已有修改混进第一个删除 commit。
-
-```bash
-git status --short --branch
-git rev-parse HEAD
-git diff --check
-```
-
-### 4.2 证据目录
-
-创建以下目录，原始输出不能只放 `/tmp`：
-
-```text
-docs/redesign/phase1-acceptance/m5-m6/
-├── baseline/
-│   ├── repository-state.txt
-│   ├── tests-before.txt
-│   ├── cargo-tree-before.txt
-│   ├── cloud-source-before.txt
-│   └── windows-before.txt
-├── batches/
-│   ├── m5a.md ... m5g.md
-│   └── m6a.md ... m6f.md
-└── final/
-    ├── manifest.md
-    ├── cargo-tree.txt
-    ├── source-scans.txt
-    ├── tests-diff.txt
-    ├── presubmit.log
-    ├── macos.md
-    └── linux.md
-```
-
-### 4.3 冻结命令
-
-```bash
-set -euo pipefail
-E=docs/redesign/phase1-acceptance/m5-m6/baseline
-mkdir -p "$E"
-{
-  date -u '+UTC=%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ'
-  git rev-parse HEAD
-  git status --short --branch
-  rustc --version
-  cargo --version
-  cargo nextest --version
-} | tee "$E/repository-state.txt"
-
-./script/test_inventory snapshot m5m6-before
-cp docs/redesign/baseline/m5m6-before.txt "$E/tests-before.txt"
-
-cargo tree -p warp --no-default-features --features local_only -e normal \
-  | tee "$E/cargo-tree-before.txt"
-
-rg -n -i 'serverapi|warp_server|firebase|cloud[_ -]?object|warp drive|session sharing|\bagent\b' \
-  app crates --glob '*.rs' --glob 'Cargo.toml' \
-  | tee "$E/cloud-source-before.txt"
-
-git ls-files | rg '(^|/)windows(/|[^/]*\.rs$)|windows(_wm)?\.rs$' \
-  | tee "$E/windows-before.txt"
-```
-
-命令中 `rg` 有命中是基线成功，不要因退出码 0/1 误判。每个最终负向扫描都必须使用
-`if rg ...; then exit 1; fi`，不能只把输出 pipe 到 `tee` 后凭肉眼判断。
-
